:name: Pocket WX Radio on the XIAO nRF52840
:description: Loads the XIAO image on Renode's nRF52840 platform.

# Set by tests/renode/run.sh: the image, the platform (Renode's nRF52840 with
# Nordic's local SVD) and where the console goes.
$elf ?= @build-xiao/app/zephyr/zephyr.elf
$platform ?= @platforms/cpus/nrf52840.repl
$uartlog ?= @uart.log

using sysbus
mach create "xiao"
machine LoadPlatformDescription $platform

# FICR part code and revision, which the SoftDevice's errata checks read:
# an nRF52840 (0x08), revision 3. Renode leaves FICR unmapped (zeros).
sysbus Tag <0x10000130 4> "FICR_PART_CODE" 0x8
sysbus Tag <0x10000134 4> "FICR_REVISION" 0x3

sysbus LoadELF $elf
cpu VectorTableOffset `sysbus GetSymbolAddress "_vector_table"`
uart0 CreateFileBackend $uartlog true
